## Built-in Plugins
> Owl Carousel uses a modular plugin structure. Custom source builds can omit plugins that are not needed or add new plugins.



### Plugins included

The build bundles these source modules, in the order defined by `build/entry.js`, into `dist/owl.carousel.js` and `dist/owl.carousel.min.js`:


```no-highlight
src/
└── js/
	├── owl.animate.js
    ├── owl.autorefresh.js
    ├── owl.autoplay.js
    ├── owl.autoheight.js
    ├── owl.carousel.js
    ├── owl.hash.js
    ├── owl.lazyload.js
    ├── owl.navigation.js
    └── owl.video.js
```

> [See demos of built-in plugins](../demos/demos.html#using-built-in-plugins)

